abstract: >-
  Code for the analysis of behavioural and EEG data of a probabilistic
  reinforcement learning task with omissions of rewards and losses:
  reinforcement learning modelling (MATLAB), behavioural analyses and
  sample-wise linear mixed models of feedback- and omission-related EEG
  amplitudes (R).
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - prediction error
  - omission
  - EEG
  - event-related potentials
